 dosing=f'''<h2 id="dosing">How to take collagen peptides: what we know</h2><ul><li>The trials gave hydrolyzed collagen by mouth, usually daily. One meta-analysis concluded that about 90 days of use improved skin measures ({pm(33742704,"PMID 33742704")}).</li><li>The abstracts we checked don't list one standard amount. Studies used different products and sources ({pm(37432180,"PMID 37432180")}).</li><li>Follow the product label, and check with a clinician if you're pregnant, have kidney disease, or have allergies to the source (fish, bovine, etc.).</li></ul>''',
